OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will
OL,6,Fclear away northeastwards this
OL,7,Fevening. Then the rest of the night
OL,8,Fwill be dry with variable amounts of
OL,9,Fcloud and clear periods. A touch of
OL,10,Ffrost and some icy patches on
OL,11,Funtreated roads.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FAfter a dry and bright start
OL,14,Fshowery rain, possibly heavy, will
OL,15,Fspread east for a time in the morning.
OL,16,FMainly dry and bright in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
