OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMild
OL,6,Fand windy on Monday with rain, heavy
OL,7,Fin some western areas, patchy in
OL,8,FMoray. Early rain on Tuesday then dry
OL,9,Fand bright. Mainly dry and bright
OL,10,FWednesday.
